# ============================================================
# plan: vent_to_ambient -- bring a sealed chamber back to air
# ============================================================
# Lets air into a chamber that is resting under vacuum, once the platen and shroud
# are safe to open to air.
#
# Start: sealed under vacuum, as rest_from_ambient leaves it: vacuum pump off,
#   every valve closed.
# End:   at atmosphere, above 700 Torr, with the vent valve open as the chamber's
#   own screen leaves it. The door may then be opened.
# Fails: the platen or shroud is not between 10 and 60 °C within 60 minutes, or the
#   chamber does not reach 700 Torr within 10 minutes. The zones are left as they
#   were.

load rLACO
record every 5 s

vent within 60 min
log at atmosphere; the vent valve is open
